# The build context of Dockerfile: the app's sources only. Never secrets (.env*, keys) or local builds, anywhere in the
# tree: a pattern without **/ matches only at the root, and .claude holds session worktrees (whole repository copies).
.git
.claude
.superpowers
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-production
**/.vercel
**/.env*
**/*.pem
kotlin
server
api
api-docs
infra
tests
test-results
playwright-report
coverage
docs
*.md
